                    "range": 18,
                    "effect": "Place a large (5\") blast template so that its central hole is directly over the center of the target enemy unit. Once placed, the template will scatter D3+1\". Any enemy model whose base lies underneath the template's final position risks being hit and suffering Strength 4 hit with an AP of -2. these hits have the Flaming Attacks special rule.",
                    "number": 2
                },
